  "title": {
    "rendered": "እማማ ዘውዲቱ ድርጅት ውስጥ ያደጉ አራት ልጆችን አስመረቀ"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>የእማማ ዘውዲቱ ድርጅት ጥቅምት 6/2015 ዓ.ም በድርጅቱ ውስጥ ያደጉ አራት ልጆችን አስመረቀ በዕለቱ ከተለያዩ ተቋማት የተመረቁት ተማሪዎች 2 በማስተርስ 2 ደግሞ በዲፕሎማ የተመረቁ ናቸው ተማሪዎቹ በምረቃቸው ወቅት ለእዚህ ክብር ያበቃቸውን የእማማ ዘውዲቱ እና የድርጅቱን ድካም አቅም በፈቀደ ሁሉ ለመመለስና ሀገራቸው በመጥቀም ብድራቸውን ለመመለስ እንደሚተጉ ተናግረዋል።</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-40.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-948\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-40-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-40-225x300.jpg 225w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-40-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-40-18x24.jpg 18w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-40-27x36.jpg 27w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-40-36x48.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-40.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></a> <a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-43.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-949\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-43-300x135.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"135\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-43-300x135.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-43-1024x462.jpg 1024w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-43-768x346.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-43-24x11.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-43-36x16.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-43-48x22.jpg 48w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/photo_2022-10-18_11-55-43.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>የእማማ ዘውዲቱ ድርጅት ጥቅምት 6/2015 ዓ.ም በድርጅቱ ውስጥ ያደጉ አራት ልጆችን አስመረቀ በዕለቱ ከተለያዩ ተቋማት የተመረቁት ተማሪዎች 2 በማስተርስ 2 ደግሞ በዲፕሎማ የተመረቁ ናቸው ተማሪዎቹ በምረቃቸው ወቅት ለእዚህ ክብር ያበቃቸውን የእማማ ዘውዲቱ እና የድርጅቱን ድካም አቅም በፈቀደ ሁሉ ለመመለስና ሀገራቸው በመጥቀም ብድራቸውን ለመመለስ እንደሚተጉ ተናግረዋል።</p>\n",
